  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WANEP, West Africa Network for Peacebuilding - WANEP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WANEP, West Africa Network for Peacebuilding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WANEP is a regional peace and security organisation with over 450 member organisations spread throughout West Africa. WANEP engages major actors, particularly governments and intergovernmental bodies to establish a platform for dialogue, thereby complementing efforts at ensuring sustainable peace and development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WANEP &#xE4;r en regional fred och s&#xE4;kerhetsorganisation med &#xF6;ver 450 medlemsorganisationer spridda runt i V&#xE4;stafrika. WANEP engagerar viktiga akt&#xF6;rer, framf&#xF6;r allt regeringar och regionala organisationer, fr.a. ECOWAS, f&#xF6;r att etablera en plattform f&#xF6;r dialog, erfarenhetsutbyte och l&#xE4;rande, f&#xF6;r att &#xE5;stadkomma varaktig fred och utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
